# krkrz_web kit patch: the web demo delivers its data as one gamedata/data.xp3.
#
# stage_web.py gains a delivery:"xp3" source mode (mirrored sources merge into a
# single XP3 instead of loose files, and webconfig.js gets
# KRKRZ_WEB_PROJECT_XP3), pre.js then opens the project as web://./data.xp3> --
# the engine supports an archive project path natively (stdapp.cpp), and its
# HttpStorageMedia existence check reads the manifest, which lists the archive.
# xp3pack.py gains the library entry points and two fixes: the index name order
# is the engine's UTF-16-le binary-search assumption, and a streamed index goes
# back into the file being packed, not stdin.
#
# Upstream: ozerune1/krkrz_web branch web-xp3 (a PR against wamsoft/krkrz_web
# replaces this file when it lands). Applied by platforms.yml right after the
# kit clone; when the KRKRZ_WEB_SHA pin moves, rebase this patch and rerun the
# web job.
